<title>NETHERLANDS: Volker Stevin 96 net profit Dfl 73 mln.</title>
<headline>Volker Stevin 96 net profit Dfl 73 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-December 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    13.90 vs  12.00</p>
<p>    Net profit			    73    vs  58.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  5.60 vs   4.80</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Volker Stevin to report 1996 net profit from ordinary operations of between 64 and 77 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Turnover on completed work (blns)2.93 vs   2.66</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    76    vs  58</p>
<p>    Interest income			6    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Tax					7    vs   6</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		4 loss vs   1 gain</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
